="_blank"&gt;&lt;img alt="替代" border="0" src="https://sli.bloomberg.com/imp?s=868567&amp;amp;stpe=default&amp;amp;li_coord=mobile&amp;amp;collapse_width=550&amp;amp;li=19203815&amp;amp;m=d42b0cd27465a66be4227a135cb7a14e&amp;amp;p=07312026100007&amp;amp;lctg=8b37da73-f2d1-4a1c-8a9f-cb9d10343de6" style="display: block; height: auto;" width="100%" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;!--&lt;![endif]--&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&lt;h3 style="font-size: 24px; line-height: 30px; font-weight: 700; padding-top: 12px; border-top: 1px solid; margin-top: 40px;"&gt;全球必读&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p style="margin-top: 24px; font-size: 16px;"&gt;唐纳德·特朗普总统表示，&lt;strong style="font-size: 16px;"&gt;美国领导的和平委员会&lt;/strong&gt;达成了哈马斯解除武装的协议，称这是加沙和以色列“迈向持久和平与安全的&lt;a href="https://links.message.bloomberg.com/a/sc/QbjNuuV5mW3o68RI570ZHs4l9sbW-UkXXJiv9VaB9dWl1nz-6qXK0XkqGO6mtnIA0MOSMu1y1UYvz6798wqswEf2DhOGQA5qmDx8PnoUgSOxXfyvLg63xJwoWJV7Scz-XaqbGiLL6UD6uNnupXkoC0EPlEiLC3xpb3sM36McLGllYlKyrs52pewgeSSKm-XEXWdiMCm8GS1vfATU1HkWi9Z-B1We3UXnotK-iHmQK7VEfTeA0qQavYKQoU1RXHuEa455ouClwkYkwuug0mAmrK5PO0JJnhJWA1ni5sJzQ_bMmPN4nh3-zUWAxezNaA4mC3j_lvrIE1anGXoZqUKfME07GIP139dXylBvSMLJqbTukdDOm_hd4IfYKyiz8S1sfLU3uapP-AnZaV19X9qGdf6potgLqHiFEQgNsDK3MkWc65MHHhspmsf-ZyXQu-rhdFhvzpy3sZGxREtXDZ0pVrDGMXPMhA4cdeasx41sTAJZFRKWRFE7M8IPPqte2cvBkbBIrnbLvNQRzdIVK4FWNh2-oprvd4KSteWGW9QSiw/AKX3U_myHaLfo-M15iDxGGc6znoQqjXM/23" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="font-size: inherit; color: #00e;" target="_blank" title="特朗普称哈马斯将解除武装，但协议仍存疑问"&gt;里程碑式一步&lt;/a&gt;”。该协议的范围仍存在疑问，官员们表示该协议不会立即实施，但如果该协议得以维持，这将标志着美国和伊朗之间冲突持续存在的中东地区取得重大突破。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure style="margin: 20px 0;"&gt; &lt;a href="https://links.message.bloomberg.com/a/sc/kT5YrElS1Wb0TH3ajDcfyAirfHU6uTcGHh440Da680qXM7eSagK6NHjKQlyDlRezQdV76Fpg66mPU_JDoDHFm52eQh7AG-fS3e6ijZO57DGiPVM9RMgUOMjKHf8IuTZ-fcfptrXJ9wQOnqOlywN4ivosxnQLd79oc19AkCvnOwsKG0uXPnAB9UZFCUiJJDoNZspTH4xo7chrfGPnT75kLyx_pwAc5W4MR-kIkqW8BWKFDayLHQT2QYRd9Q60008OJda7hYRLdD6d6aK